      "title": "Strava Raises Prices But Can't Tell You How Much It Costs Anymore",
      "venue": "TrainerRoad forum (community hosted by TrainerRoad, a training app adjacent to Strava)",
      "speaker": "buyer",
      "published": "2023-01",
      "pulled": "2026-10-12",
      "verbatim": "Never paid for Strave, never will. The KOM crap is full of cheats motorpacing and eBikes…how worthless. | It’s not worth it. It gives me zero return on my investment. | None of their paid content is worthwhile IMO. | Now my choice looks be to give them $60/yr → $80/year for features I don’t really use. | Strava appears to just be increasing and for what."
    },
    {
      "id": "src:2",
      "url": "https://www.trustpilot.com/review/strava.com?page=5",
      "title": "Strava reviews, Trustpilot page 5",
      "venue": "Trustpilot",
