    },
    {
      "id": "src:3",
      "url": "https://www.trustpilot.com/review/strava.com?page=10",
      "title": "Strava reviews, Trustpilot page 10",
      "venue": "Trustpilot",
      "speaker": "buyer",
      "published": null,
      "pulled": "2026-10-12",
      "verbatim": "Gordon Eastman (1 star, 2022-04-04): they do nothing about E bikes or rides being recorded as runs ruining the leaderboards. | JM (1 star, 2021-11-07): Consistently fails to record distance and time. | Marc (1 star, 2021-09-12): it records if it feels like it, usually on a day when I would really like to see the stats it deletes them | Tim Deen (1 star, 2022-06-21): Downloaded the free strava app it doesn't do anything, just trying to sell the premium app. | Clayton Werner (1 star, 2021-09-09): Its almost impossible to cancel the subscription, and they charge you 1 day before your subscription runs out. | John (5 stars, 2022-04-06): Only using the free app version so far for my runs and I really like it. | Ruggero Guttilla (5 stars, 2021-09-07): accurate data, free account with already several features."
    },
    {
      "id": "src:4",
